# Web Development Assignment — CSS Layouts, Grid Gallery, & Sticky Navigation

This repository contains a complete multi-page web application demonstrating CSS Flexbox, CSS Grid, media queries, sticky positioning, and semantic HTML5.

## Project Structure
```text
├── index.html         # Task 1: Landing Page (Flexbox)
├── gallery.html       # Task 2: Photo Gallery (CSS Grid)
├── sticky-nav.html    # Task 3: Sticky Navigation & Bonus Accordion FAQ
├── styles.css         # Unified master stylesheet
└── README.md          # Project documentation